&lt;p&gt;Braze is looking for a pioneer to fill a highly strategic, hybrid role within our Japan team. As the &lt;strong&gt;AI Decisioning Lead,&lt;/strong&gt; you will own the end-to-end AI lifecycle for our customers in Japan. This is a unique, multi-disciplinary role combining &lt;strong&gt;sales &lt;/strong&gt;(supporting the sales team as a technical SME) and &lt;strong&gt;post-sales &lt;/strong&gt;(facilitating the forward-deployed delivery of AI Decisioning to contracted customers).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the ultimate subject matter expert on AI Decisioning capabilities, helping brands predict customer behavior, automate orchestration, and scale hyper-personalized engagement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is scoped as an Individual Contributor role to start, but could grow into a management role as the Braze’s AI Decisioning business grows in Japan and APAC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visionary Pitching:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the Sales Team to present and demo AI Decisioning capabilities and roadmap to prospective C-level executives (CMOs, CDOs, CTOs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct discovery workshops to identify top AI Decisioning use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Academy: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead hands-on educational sessions with prospects and customers that give a strong understanding of current trends and applications of artificial intelligence in marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Readiness Assessment: Assist sales team in identifying and mitigating program risks (e.g., business case, tech stack) before deals are signed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post-sales (forward-deployed) responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adoption &amp;amp; Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a dedicated AI Success Manager for high-value clients, ensuring they maximize and fully understand the value of their investment into AI Decisioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Facilitate the technical setup of AI Decisioning fully aligns to business goals and internal best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze client campaign performance data to deliver strategic recommendations and insights, showcasing how AI Decisioning is driving incremental value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Troubleshooting:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the technical bridge between Japan clients and global product/engineering teams for complex AI/ML anomalies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Architecture &amp;amp; Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with client data teams to ensure clean data pipelines flow from Data Warehouses (Snowflake, Databricks, BigQuery) into Braze for AI modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience in a highly technical, enterprise client-facing role (e.g., Solutions Architect, Forward-Deployed Engineer, Technical Account Manager, or Data Consultant).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Science Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong hands-on experience with SQL, Python/R, and latest AI tools for data analysis and machine learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Statistical Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of machine learning concepts and how they apply to consumer marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MarTech Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the modern data stack and marketing ecosystem (CDPs, Data Warehouses like Snowflake/BigQuery, and CRM/Marketing Automation tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Native/Fluent Japanese&lt;/strong&gt; (for local client management) and Business-level English (to collaborate with global product teams and technical documentation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to translate complex data science and AI jargon into clear, value-driven business language for non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agility:&lt;/strong&gt; A &quot;builder&quot; mentality—comfortable navigating ambiguity and defining a brand-new role in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote, #LI-Hybrid, #LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
