&lt;li&gt;Educational background:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Associates degree in Engineering or Computer Science (or equivalent field), or 5+ years relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
